<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:02.733">Here in Mississippi, there are<br />a lot of interesting words</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.733" end="00:00:04.133">that begin with the letter &quot;z.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:04.133" end="00:00:05.133">&quot;Z.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.133" end="00:00:06.133">(makes &quot;z&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.133" end="00:00:08.467">Zebra.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.467" end="00:00:10.200">Zero.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.200" end="00:00:12.000">Ziti.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.000" end="00:00:14.267">Zither.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.267" end="00:00:16.267">Zipper.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.267" end="00:00:17.133">&quot;Z.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.133" end="00:00:18.133">(makes &quot;z&quot; sound)</p>
